{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423321001:1":{"text":"먼저 낚싯바늘에 미끼를 꿰고, 던진 다음 찌를 살핀다... 어느 정도는 이해했어요. 저도 한번 해볼게요!","source_cn":"先往鱼钩上挂上饵料，再甩钩，观察浮漂……我大概了解了。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E571589E480BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1423321002:0":{"text":"여러 번 연습한 끝에, 오로나는 작은 무지개 송어를 낚아올렸다.","source_cn":"练习多次后，欧罗娜终于钓上了一条体型较小的染虹鳟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32BE14F71E76FE57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423321003:1":{"text":"낚였어요!","source_cn":"上钩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD97174CAF641FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423321004:0":{"text":"찬란한 비늘 색, 규칙적인 둥근 반점... 책에서 본 무지개 송어네요! 이렇게 실제로 본 건 처음이에요...","source_cn":"鳞片的颜色五彩斑斓，上面有规律的圆形斑点……这是书上提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B51204936E2159B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":